        "# DGP-001: Establish the Deepstate Inc Endowment and Activate Rewarder V2 Slash $DEEP Issuance by ~90%\\n\\n| Review field | Value |\\n| --- | --- |\\n| Intended proposer | `0x5F43Cd8B5Eead549de4444a644B4Cb425A4ea5b2` |\\n| Production deployment commit | `866f002` |\\n| Production deployment blocks | `52001883`–`52001912` |\\n| Post-deployment fork block | `52005951` |\\n| Post-deployment fork block hash | `0x171944f34f37a0ec4bdc941a27968441c513039f841a5acdc5b404208cec3c90` |\\n\\nThe endowment amount in this proposal is fixed when the Bootstrap is deployed: its constructor reads both legacy NVDA/USDG Rewarder `totalAccrued` counters and permanently stores `floor((token0 accrued + token1 accrued) × 30 / 100)`, so any later accrual, including accrual during voting, is excluded. The fifteen-call execution explicitly re-revokes the deployer—the only historical external DEEP minter—temporarily grants the Bootstrap mint authority, calls its minimal `mint()` to send that immutable amount to the Governor, immediately revokes the authority, and has the Governor directly approve Sablier and create a noncancelable, nontransferable stream for `0x83fB2739abd9963c5341E4A176D93a7E5Ee73445`; the Governor is both funder and sender, and the complete endowment unlocks linearly over exactly one year with no cliff or initial unlock. It then makes the Minter Controller DEEP’s sole token administrator and token-level minter for an exact 730-day window, during which every controlled primary mint creates an additional one-year linear stream containing `floor(primary mint × 30 / 70)` DEEP so that Deepstate Inc receives 30% of the combined issuance, subject to an immutable maximum live supply of 3 billion DEEP; burns reduce live supply and restore headroom beneath that maximum. The same atomic execution transfers the Router to the Governor-owned V1 Controller, grants the Factory only its delegated minting and hook-management permissions, explicitly configures the canonical USDG/NVDA pair with one-million-USDG and 5,000-NVDA whole-unit maxima, replaces the operationally prepared hook with a fully funded Rewarder V2 whose complete maximum is 100 million DEEP—50 million per side over exactly 365 days—and appoints the Deepstate Inc address as the Factory’s revocable operator; the generic Factory lets that trusted operator launch or relaunch any canonical token pair, directly replace or unlink whatever Router hook is currently installed without an expected-Rewarder guard, choose both whole-unit maxima and side flags, and separately burn balances of Factory-owned Rewarders, while the three-day cooldown, Minter Controller\\'s 3 billion DEEP maximum supply and exact 730-day window, governance revocation, and offchain predecessor/idleness gates constrain that authority and the transparent time-vested relationship gives Deepstate Inc a durable, venture-investable operating endowment.\\n\\n\\n#proposer=0x5f43cd8b5eead549de4444a644b4cb425a4ea5b2"
